4.6 Order factors with {forcats}
{forcats} lets you reorder those levels so graphs tell the story you want:



penguins |&gt;
  dplyr::mutate(species = forcats::fct_reorder(
    .f = species, 
    .x = bill_length_mm, 
    .fun = median, 
    na.rm = TRUE
  )) |&gt;
  ggplot(mapping = aes(
    x = species, 
    y = bill_length_mm, 
    fill = species
  )) +
  geom_boxplot()











fct_reorder() puts the highest median first on the axis: order becomes part of your message. fct_relevel/fct_lump fine-tune and collapse rare levels.


markdown## Order factors with [{forcats}](https://forcats.tidyverse.org) {.inv}

